# What must not travel into the image.
#
# `node_modules` and `dist` are rebuilt inside the image from the lockfile; the release output, the
# test scratch dir and the review data have no business in a published artefact either.

.git
.github
node_modules
dist
extension/dist
release-assets
.tmp
reviews
spec
*.log
*.tgz
# the test-grant build (B.7.5) is a host-granted copy of extension/dist; it must never
# travel into an image, and no Docker target needs it.
extension/dist-test
